Voted "event of the year" last month by [@chuffedskates](https://www.instagram.com/chuffedskates/) community, our event will take place in Lyon (France) on the 24-26th of april this year!\
\
A weekend of meet up, contest, workshop, gifts for tricks, games, solidarity and even a roller disco inside the skatepark 💃\
\
We want to show that every rollerskater is part of the community no matter the age, level or gender and that we can all enjoy our passion together during the whole weekend 🤩\
\
The contest and workshop registrations will be open soon, stay tune!
